    },
    "Hermes downloads it from github.com/goosehouse-llc/redde and switches it on. It is the same plugin the command in a terminal installs." : {

    },
    "Hermes gives each bot's chat a tool to message the other bots, so you can say “@scout, what do you think?” in one bot's chat and have it ask. Redde turns this on the way Hermes Desktop does, by setting your main profile up as a bot on the server. Chats with your agent stay as they are." : {

