    },
    "Hermes server" : {

    },
    "Hermes takes the API_SERVER_KEY in the profile's own .env (~/.hermes/profiles/<name>/.env). Put your main API key there and the name alone does here; Hermes 0.21.3 and later leave it out when they copy a profile. Hermes 0.21.5 and later serve every profile over the API; on 0.21.3 and earlier, set gateway.multiplex_profiles: true in config.yaml and restart the gateway." : {

