    },
    "On your Hermes" : {

    },
    "On-device" : {

    },
    "On-device speech recognition and synthesis. No analytics. Every request goes only to the servers you configured. The exceptions are opt-in: with “Let Siri use Redde” on, Apple Intelligence handles what you say to Siri; with a Hermes paired under “Notify when Redde is closed”, its notifications pass through Goosehouse's relay, encrypted; and with “Sync with iCloud” on, your settings and servers are kept in your own iCloud, their keys and passwords in iCloud Keychain, end-to-end encrypted." : {

    },
    "On, %@ sees a skill listed and reads it only when it needs it. Off, it doesn't see it at all. Pinned (%@), it reads the skill in full at the start of every message: keep that to the few it needs every time, as each makes every message slower to start. A pin takes effect in new chats, and in %@'s ongoing chat once that starts fresh or is condensed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "On, %1$@ sees a skill listed and reads it only when it needs it. Off, it doesn't see it at all. Pinned (%2$@), it reads the skill in full at the start of every message: keep that to the few it needs every time, as each makes every message slower to start. A pin takes effect in new chats, and in %3$@'s ongoing chat once that starts fresh or is condensed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
